---
const expertise = [
  { title: 'Full-stack web', desc: 'React, Astro, TypeScript, Node.js' },
  { title: 'Automation', desc: 'Browser extensions, Apps Script, CI/CD' },
  { title: 'Developer tooling', desc: 'Go & Rust CLIs, daemons, plugins' },
  { title: 'Integrations & data', desc: 'REST APIs, Meta CAPI, PostgreSQL, MongoDB' },
  { title: 'Performance & quality', desc: 'Web Vitals, testing, accessibility' },
  { title: 'Cloud & delivery', desc: 'AWS, Docker, GitHub Actions, Vercel' },
];

const stats = [
  { value: '5+', label: 'Years of experience' },
  { value: '25+', label: 'Projects delivered' },
  { value: '13', label: 'Public repositories' },
  { value: '4', label: 'Languages: TS · Go · Rust · Python' },
];
---
<section id="about" class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10 py-20 md:py-28">
    <h2 class="reveal text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight">About me</h2>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-7 text-[17px] md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-bone/90 font-light">
      <p class="reveal">
        Hi! I'm a full-stack developer who likes the part after the demo: the interfaces, services and small pieces of automation that make a product hold up in daily use. Over the last 5+ years I've shipped React and Astro frontends, Node services, browser automation and internal tools for teams at Arbusta, Meta and Bridge for Billions.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        I move comfortably between the product layer and the plumbing underneath - designing a clean screen in the morning, then wiring the API, the scheduled job or the CLI that keeps it fed. Lately that has meant building open-source developer tools in Go and Rust, and contributing to Rust projects like Postal and Corcho.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h3 class="reveal mt-14 text-4xl md:text-[42px] font-extralight tracking-tight">Areas of Expertise</h3>
    <div class="reveal mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-line/40 border hairline">
      {expertise.map((e) => (
        <div class="bg-ink-soft/95 p-5 md:p-6">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-light text-bone">{e.title}</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-bone-faint font-light leading-relaxed">{e.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="reveal mt-14 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-line/40 border hairline overflow-hidden">
      {stats.map((s) => (
        <div class="bg-ink-soft/95 p-6">
          <div class="text-4xl font-extralight text-bone">{s.value}</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-bone-faint font-light">{s.label}</div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-2xl text-bone-faint font-light leading-relaxed">
      Philosophy: build for the person who inherits the code, automate the boring parts, and keep learning in public. Based in Montevideo, Uruguay.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
